CLI.md §3.15, API.md §15: a project.canon with errors prints its findings as JSON lines, exit 2.
-- args --
edit req.json
-- req.json --
{"ops":[]}
-- project.canon --
project acme {
  canon: "9.9"
}
-- want --
[exit 2]
[stdout]
{"severity":"error","code":"E1001","file":"project.canon","line":2,"col":10,"endLine":2,"endCol":15,"package":"","message":"project requires Canon 9.9; this compiler supports 0.1"}
{"summary":{"errors":1,"warnings":0,"packages":0,"ms":0}}
[stderr]
